<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa details Jan-April traffic figure.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa details Jan-April traffic figure.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG released the following traffic figures for January-April 1997 with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>Lufthansa Group:</p>
<p> Passengers (in thousands)		12,837  up  4.4  pct</p>
<p> Available seat-km (millions)	   38,372  up  6.6  pct</p>
<p> Revenue passenger-km (millions)	27,183  up 12.7  pct</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (percent)	  70.8  up  3.9  pct pts</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (millions)	   6,781  up  5.1  pct</p>
<p> Revenue tonne-km (millions)	     4,745  up  7.6  pct</p>
<p> Overall load factor (percent)	    70.0  up  1.7  pct pts</p>
<p> Number of flights			 200,577  up  6.7  pct</p>
<p>Lufthansa also gave the following breakdown on its regional operations for January-April.</p>
<p>European operations, including Germany:</p>
<p> Passengers (in thousands)		10,097  up  1.6  pct</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (millions)	   1,752  up  4.3  pct</p>
<p> Revenue tonne-km (millions)		 985  up  4.8  pct</p>
<p> Overall load factor (percent)	    56.2  up  0.2  pct pts</p>
<p>North and South America operations:</p>
<p> Passengers (in thousands)		1,368   up 20.2  pct</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (millions)	  2,478   up  7.0  pct</p>
<p> Revenue tonne-km (millions)	    1,899   up 11.3  pct</p>
<p> Overall load factor (percent)	   76.6   up  3.0  pct pts</p>
<p>Asia-Pacific, Middle East and Africa operations:</p>
<p> Passengers (in thousands)		1,346   up 12.2  pct</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (millions)	  2,509   up  2.9  pct</p>
<p> Revenue tonne-km (millions)	    1,833   up  4.7  pct</p>
<p> Overall load factor (percent)	   73.1   up  1.3  pct pts</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
